  "prompt": "The query in the editor has one mistake. Fix it so that it answers this question: for each cost version that has ended (its valid_to is not missing), on how many days did that cost apply? valid_from and valid_to are both days on which the cost applied. Return three columns, in this order: product_id, valid_from, and days_applied. Return one row for each of those cost versions. Any row order is fine.",
